<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7473] .NET: &quot;Could not load file or assembly ConfigurationManager&quot; error on Linux</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7473</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
dotnet &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; console
dotnet add &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; Apache.Ignite
nano Program.cs  # Add Ignition.Start() line and a namespace &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;
dotnet run
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Unhandled Exception: &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.IO.FileNotFoundException: Could not load file or assembly &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.Configuration.ConfigurationManager, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=cc7b13ffcd2ddd51&apos;&lt;/span&gt;. The system cannot find the file specified.
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Works on Windows, does not work on Linux.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;PackageReference Include=&quot;System.Configuration.ConfigurationManager&quot; Version=&quot;4.4.0&quot; /&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt; is required to fix the issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, &lt;tt&gt;ConfigurationManager&lt;/tt&gt; is not necessary for code configuration, we should be able to start without it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
